      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hlaford his þeowan freolsdæge nyde to weorce, gylde lahslitte [se hlaford] inne on Deone lage ⁊ wíte mid Englum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a slave is compelled to work by his lord during a church festival, he [the lord] shall pay lahslit within the Danelagh, and a fine in an English district.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hlaford his ðeowan freolsdæge nyde to weorce, gylde lahslitte se hlaford inne on Dæne lage ⁊ wite mid Englum.</ab>
      </div>
